   "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/766570/extras/f8a8ca2f2ce0243be931d7fa0c9f1b60.avif?t=1752656375\" width=618 height=151 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >超過230種魚類，未來將持續擴充。</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/766570/extras/68a266fea7cf3b4ce0baab9c7b58bc49.avif?t=1752656375\" width=616 height=137 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >龐大的釣魚用具庫，包含數百種現代釣竿、釣線輪和配件。</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/766570/extras/5b0f5e2e439b153e833dff329d0ef4f5.avif?t=1752656375\" width=616 height=151 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >現有18個水域，各具獨特天氣條件與多樣化魚群。</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/766570/extras/52437327e33f638d9d6f0daac9075949.avif?t=1752656375\" width=616 height=100 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >水域間可自由移動，選擇岸釣或船釣。  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/766570/extras/f14321fbc769fe32bd9217864dc37fc9.avif?t=1752656375\" width=616 height=198 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >精心設計的各種釣魚方式，例如浮釣、底釣、紡車釣和海釣等，搭配多種鉤組和技巧，還原真實的釣魚體驗。 </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/766570/extras/b1629044528f4d1c30ff629645d3ec4b.avif?t=1752656375\" width=616 height=177 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >與現實生活中一樣，魚的行為可能會因天氣條件，一天中的時間和其他因素而異。 </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/766570/extras/da6d2da729edd1c069cbe039e454b166.avif?t=1752656375\" width=616 height=152 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >提供充足的技能發展空間，涵蓋所選專精及相關領域，如自製擬餌、採集餌料及烹飪。 </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/766570/extras/b441bd3818dcddb2a904d76d755e722d.avif?t=1752656375\" width=616 height=175 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >遊戲世界不斷進化，持續更新追加內容以完善釣魚體驗。</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/766570/extras/6eb0ddd021c12c3d6c611fed218029a6.avif?t=1752656375\" width=617 height=201 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >與其他玩家角逐排行榜、資格賽以及統計數據；參與各種挑戰和錦標賽，贏取豐厚的獎品。</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/766570/extras/4cbb104d3924d282c1023403b9c8538d.avif?t=1752656375\" width=616 height=150 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >學習魚類習性，掌握打造完美釣組的知識，捕獲您夢寐以求的稀有魚種。</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/766570/extras/91275544de6eccdd2711f9df9500b9e5.avif?t=1752656375\" width=617 height=150 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >俄羅斯釣魚4，水邊見！ </p>",
   "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/766570/extras/f8a8ca2f2ce0243be931d7fa0c9f1b60.avif?t=1752656375\" width=618 height=151 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >超過230種魚類，未來將持續擴充。</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/766570/extras/68a266fea7cf3b4ce0baab9c7b58bc49.avif?t=1752656375\" width=616 height=137 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >龐大的釣魚用具庫，包含數百種現代釣竿、釣線輪和配件。</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/766570/extras/5b0f5e2e439b153e833dff329d0ef4f5.avif?t=1752656375\" width=616 height=151 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >現有18個水域，各具獨特天氣條件與多樣化魚群。</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/766570/extras/52437327e33f638d9d6f0daac9075949.avif?t=1752656375\" width=616 height=100 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >水域間可自由移動，選擇岸釣或船釣。  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/766570/extras/f14321fbc769fe32bd9217864dc37fc9.avif?t=1752656375\" width=616 height=198 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >精心設計的各種釣魚方式，例如浮釣、底釣、紡車釣和海釣等，搭配多種鉤組和技巧，還原真實的釣魚體驗。 </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/766570/extras/b1629044528f4d1c30ff629645d3ec4b.avif?t=1752656375\" width=616 height=177 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >與現實生活中一樣，魚的行為可能會因天氣條件，一天中的時間和其他因素而異。 </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/766570/extras/da6d2da729edd1c069cbe039e454b166.avif?t=1752656375\" width=616 height=152 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >提供充足的技能發展空間，涵蓋所選專精及相關領域，如自製擬餌、採集餌料及烹飪。 </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/766570/extras/b441bd3818dcddb2a904d76d755e722d.avif?t=1752656375\" width=616 height=175 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >遊戲世界不斷進化，持續更新追加內容以完善釣魚體驗。</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/766570/extras/6eb0ddd021c12c3d6c611fed218029a6.avif?t=1752656375\" width=617 height=201 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >與其他玩家角逐排行榜、資格賽以及統計數據；參與各種挑戰和錦標賽，贏取豐厚的獎品。</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/766570/extras/4cbb104d3924d282c1023403b9c8538d.avif?t=1752656375\" width=616 height=150 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >學習魚類習性，掌握打造完美釣組的知識，捕獲您夢寐以求的稀有魚種。</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/766570/extras/91275544de6eccdd2711f9df9500b9e5.avif?t=1752656375\" width=617 height=150 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >俄羅斯釣魚4，水邊見！ </p>",
   "short_description": "俄羅斯釣魚4是一款帶有角色扮演元素的釣魚模擬遊戲。您將在沒有主線故事和其他約束的開放世界中自由探索，體驗硬核擬真的釣魚樂趣。",
